# Syr Vondam, the Lucent {2}{W}{B}{B} 4/4 deathtouch, lifelink: "Whenever Syr Vondam enters or attacks, other creatures you control get +1/+0 and gain deathtouch until end of turn." On turn 1 Bot1 casts a Memnite and
# an Ornithopter, then Syr Vondam with a Black Lotus (BBB), a Mox Pearl and a Mox Jet: as it enters, the Memnite is a 2/1 and the Ornithopter a 1/2 flier, both with deathtouch, and Syr Vondam itself is still a
# 4/4. On turn 2 the pump is gone (CR 514.2) and Bot2, who casts a Memnite, never had it. On turn 3 Syr Vondam attacks and the same happens again: the Memnite is a 2/1 deathtouch, Bot2's Memnite stays a 1/1
# without it, and Syr Vondam is a 4/4: 4 damage and 4 life from lifelink (Bot2: 16, Bot1: 24).

